[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 240.07, "timestamp": "00:04:00", "text": "持续了两个月。我们结束了这两个月"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 244.309, "timestamp": "00:04:04", "text": "原始循环。现在是第三个月了，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 247.229, "timestamp": "00:04:07", "text": "我们只剩下一个月了。这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 251.83, "timestamp": "00:04:11", "text": "这个月我们有很多事情要做，呃，比如……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 254.22899999999998, "timestamp": "00:04:14", "text": "呃，因为我要去日本，所以我有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 258.59, "timestamp": "00:04:18", "text": "我有很多事情需要处理。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 262.87, "timestamp": "00:04:22", "text": "所以从某种意义上说，这个月是最后一个f。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 264.55, "timestamp": "00:04:24", "text": "某种程度上，这有点像最终的结局。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 267.43, "timestamp": "00:04:27", "text": "本月和下个月都要进行拉伸。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 269.95, "timestamp": "00:04:29", "text": "呃，下个月上半月。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 272.71, "timestamp": "00:04:32", "text": "所以即使我不能做很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 275.99, "timestamp": "00:04:35", "text": "我想做的事情，因为……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 279.35, "timestamp": "00:04:39", "text": "我当时还专注于其他事情等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 281.59000000000003, "timestamp": "00:04:41", "text": "不过和大家一起玩还是很开心的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 284.909, "timestamp": "00:04:44", "text": "还有你们每一个人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 288.629, "timestamp": "00:04:48", "text": "嗯，连续两个月，每天24小时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 290.31, "timestamp": "00:04:50", "text": "虽然我大部分时间都在睡觉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 293.11, "timestamp": "00:04:53", "text": "尽管过去，尽管灯芯是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 294.83, "timestamp": "00:04:54", "text": "我一直都在这里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 296.59000000000003, "timestamp": "00:04:56", "text": "等等，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 299.43, "timestamp": "00:04:59", "text": "我仍然非常感激每一个人"}]